209
00:12:46,590 --> 00:12:48,270
Wang Lin...

210
00:12:52,150 --> 00:12:53,170
Him ?!

211
00:12:53,390 --> 00:12:54,700
That's right,

212
00:12:54,950 --> 00:12:56,270
Ceng Niu

213
00:12:56,550 --> 00:12:58,330
