218
00:13:08,290 --> 00:13:10,070
But Wang Lin is different.

219
00:13:10,250 --> 00:13:12,470
You must watch him closely

220
00:13:12,650 --> 00:13:15,030
and when his domain is ripe,

221
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:17,270
you must refine him

222
00:13:17,390 --> 00:13:19,030
into your cultivation furnace.

223
00:13:19,560 --> 00:13:21,300
When that happens,

224
00:13:21,990 --> 00:13:23,970
his Life and Death Domain

225
00:13:24,160 --> 00:13:26,210
will be yours.

226
00:13:27,590 --> 00:13:29,070
At that time,

227
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:30,850
compared to Feng’er

228
00:13:30,650 --> 00:13:32,270
you will be even more likely

229
00:13:32,450 --> 00:13:34,870
