230
00:13:35,620 --> 00:13:36,800
Disciple obeys.

231
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:49,730
Wang Lin...

232
00:13:50,890 --> 00:13:52,330
He was the only one

233
00:13:52,090 --> 00:13:55,530
