240
00:14:13,050 --> 00:14:14,730
From now on,

241
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:16,250
Main hall
Country of Suzaku

242
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:17,330
you will enter seclusion with me.

243
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:18,770
Recently,

244
00:14:19,050 --> 00:14:22,400
